      "comment": "AKII ROYALE (1) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and two minors from five tries. Was out of placings last time (23.26) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 4.5 lengths. With a clean break looks hard to beat. BARRY BULLPIT (8) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 8th at this track in Grade 5 company. Should be about the money. ZIPPING URSULA (3) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (23.22) at this track. Worth following up. MABEL'S WAY (2) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
